    "auc_coil_vs_structured": 0.8010626256854321,
    "correlation_with_plddt": -0.3350886688257012,
    "redundancy_note": "The proxy correlates with pLDDT at -0.335, so the 70/30 blend in the flexibility prior is NOT combining two independent measurements. Low enough that the embedding contributes signal of its own; high enough that the two terms should not be described as orthogonal.",
